  title: Smoke and Rumors
  content: 'The bar is loud, smoky, and full of people who know better than to speak
    first. Somewhere inside is the name you need: who currently holds the idol of
    the ancient god. To get the answer, you first need to read the room and find
    the table where information changes hands.'
